人，同上。\n\n如果不提供任何情绪控制，自动使用克隆音频作为情绪参考。\n\n重要参数说明(其他参数不是很重要的就不一一介绍了):\nfast_inference: 开启快速推理\ncustom_cuda_kernel: 开启自定义 CUDA 内核, 第一次运行将自动构建 CUDA 内核扩展\ndialogue_audio_s2: 双人会话时的第二个音频, 如果输入这个音频, 自动启动会话模式. 会话模式下, 输入文本必须如下([S1] 表示第一个说话者, [S2] 表示第二个说话者):\n"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "Note", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [300.6642150878906, 679.952880859375], "pos": [1897.5711669921875, 942.7943725585938], "id": 24, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 5}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#223", "widgets_values": ["QQ842850240_"], "inputs": [{"name": "audio", "link": 31, "label": "audio", "type": "AUDIO", "localized_name": "audio"}, {"widget": {"name": "filename_prefix"}, "name": "filename_prefix", "label": "filename_prefix", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "filename_prefix"}, {"widget": {"name": "audioUI"}, "name": "audioUI", "label": "audioUI", "type": "AUDIO_UI", "localized_name": "audioUI"}], "flags": {}, "type": "SaveAudio", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#335", "size": [284.5135498046875, 170.0542449951172], "pos": [3288.12744140625, 807.1488647460938], "id": 27, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "SaveAudio"}, "order": 7}], "extra": {"links_added_by_ue": [], "ue_links": [], "0246.VERSION": [0, 0, 4], "ds": {"offset": [-2542.363727033174, -655.9323474411784], "scale": 1.2839025177495025}}, "groups": [], "links": [[20, 32, 0, 18, 0, "AUDIO"], [21, 25, 0, 18, 1, "STRING"], [31, 18, 0, 27, 0, "AUDIO"], [35, 38, 0, 18, 17, "STRING"]], "id": "ea39f1fa-c448-426a-b1f0-f7fe1b37aec7", "config": {}, "version": 0.4, "last_node_id": 38, "revision": 0}